## Installation

Follow the official guide: [CloudBase OpenCode setup](https://docs.cloudbase.net/ai/cloudbase-ai-toolkit/ide-setup/opencode).

Add to your OpenCode config (for example `opencode.json`):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "cloudbase": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "npm-global-exec@latest",
        "@cloudbase/cloudbase-mcp@latest"
      ],
      "env": {
        "INTEGRATION_IDE": "OpenCode"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Requires Node.js 18.15+ and a CloudBase environment. Restart OpenCode after saving the config.
